1
00:00:00,558 --> 00:00:03,768
(Sheldon:)-Well, then, you have my permission.
-I didn't ask for your permission.

2
00:00:03,861 --> 00:00:05,771
(Sheldon:)Too late. No backsies.

3
00:00:07,531 --> 00:00:10,031
(Howard:)No, no, listen to me.
Sheldon misunderstood.

4
00:00:10,067 --> 00:00:11,947
(Howard:)What I meant was,
if we worked together,

5
00:00:12,036 --> 00:00:15,916
(Howard:)there'd be too much of me for you,
not the other way around.

6
00:00:15,973 --> 00:00:18,543
(Sheldon:)Howard, if you're going to lie
to your wife,

7
00:00:18,609 --> 00:00:20,749
(Sheldon:)don't start the sentence
with "Sheldon misunderstood?

8
00:00:22,547 --> 00:00:25,587
(Sheldon:)-That's a dead giveaway.
-Well?

9
00:00:25,650 --> 00:00:27,650
(Howard:)Okay, fine. I did say that,
and I think it's true.

10
00:00:27,818 --> 00:00:29,658
(Howard:)I think if we worked together
and lived together,

11
00:00:29,820 --> 00:00:32,130
(Howard:)we'd get sick of each other.

12
00:00:32,256 --> 00:00:34,896
(Sheldon:)But to be fair, he only said the part
about him getting sick of you.

13
00:00:34,959 --> 00:00:36,599
For the love of God, why?!

14
00:00:41,165 --> 00:00:43,665
(Bernadette:)What exactly do you think
you'd get sick of?

15
00:00:43,768 --> 00:00:48,078
(Raj:)His only options here are to fake
a heart attack or have a real one.

16
00:00:48,105 --> 00:00:50,775
(Howard:)It's nothing in particular.

17
00:00:50,942 --> 00:00:53,582
(Bernadette:)Is it my voice?
Am I too bossy?

18
00:00:54,946 --> 00:00:57,186
(Howard:)My arm is feeling numb.

19
00:00:59,250 --> 00:01:02,020
(Leonard:)Nailed it.

